    "balance.arrendamientos INCOMPLETO en 5 ejercicio(s): 2022: OperatingLeaseLiability (faltan FinanceLeaseLiability); 2023: OperatingLeaseLiability (faltan FinanceLeaseLiability); 2024: OperatingLeaseLiability (faltan FinanceLeaseLiability); 2025: OperatingLeaseLiability (faltan FinanceLeaseLiability); 2026: OperatingLeaseLiability (faltan FinanceLeaseLiability). Comprobar en el balance y completar a mano.",
